  "title": "Protobuf: fix the bug about parsing string format",
  "description": "Support parsing string format like:\n\n- 'a single quote string contains \"a double quote string\"'\n- \"a double quote string contains 'a single quote string'\"\n\nThat will make wireshark parsing protobuf file [TestMessage.proto](/uploads/a239e2851b727897a47accc0ec519ebc/TestMessage.proto) correctly.\n\nThis change can be cherry-picking to version release-3.6.\n\nclose #18599",
